# Monorepo conventions

## Package boundaries

- `@auth-ninja/core` — no React, Next, or Node-only server deps except Zod/crypto.
- `@auth-ninja/protocol` — OpenAPI + shared types only.
- `@auth-ninja/react` — depends on core; peer dep on React.
- `@auth-ninja/next` — depends on core + protocol; peer dep on Next.js.
- `auth-ninja` CLI — depends on core; no React.

## Imports

- Use `.js` extensions in TS source imports (NodeNext resolution).
- Workspace deps: `"@auth-ninja/core": "workspace:*"`.

## Build

- Each package builds with `tsc` to `dist/`.
- Run `pnpm build` from root via Turborepo.
- `"files": ["dist", "README.md"]` in publishable packages.

## Tests

- Vitest per package in `src/*.test.ts`.
- Do not add UI component tests to `packages/react` — hook tests only.
